EN:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}You can't just go around pushing
people around 'cause you feel like
it.{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:001B:}}It's really rude,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:000B:0004:03CD}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}¡No puedes ir por ahí empujando a
